# # /tuc-thermo/
#
# Persistent identifiers for laboratory equipment, experimental rigs and
# storage compartments used in research data management at TU Chemnitz.
#
# https://w3id.org/tuc-thermo/ and everything under it redirects to
# https://rdm.mb.tu-chemnitz.de/
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Markus Sekulla
